  "contentHtml": "<!--StartFragment-->\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">이리저리 밀려드는 일에 빠져 지내다보니 벌써 시간이 이리 되었네요</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">참 빠른 후기이지요</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >? </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 좋은_동심\">ㅎㅎㅎ</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">저희 학교에서는 협동학습으로 모둠수업을 하고 있는 </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">국어교사 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >3</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">분과 과학교사 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >2</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">분이 함께 다녀왔습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >2</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">시간의 짧은 강연이었기에 큰 기대없이 마음 가볍게 갔었지만</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >, </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">역시 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >1,2</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">편의 방송에 담겨 있던 내용에서 크게 벗어나지 않은 내용들이었답니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">다녀온 결론은 가기전보다 느낌은 좀더 얻었으나 또한 고민할 것들도 많아졌습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >.^^</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">강연은 정찬필 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >pd</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">의 거꾸로 교실을 기획하게 된 과정에 대한 내용강연과 </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">거꾸로 교실에 참여했던 선생님</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">자문을 맡으셨던 선생님들과의 질의 응답시간으로 운영되었습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >pd</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">님의 강연은 </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">앨빈토플러의 부의 미래의 한 구절로 시작해서 </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">주로 왜 교실이 바뀌어야 하는가와 그 필요성에 대한 내용들이었습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >. </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">거꾸로 교실 운영 이후 </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">아이들의 성적상승</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >(</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">피디님은 이것을 거꾸로 교실을 확산시키기 위한 미끼라고 하더군요</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >.)</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">이나</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">아이들이 중심이 된 교실 풍경 외에도 </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">아이들끼리의 소통에도 어떤 긍정적인 메시지를 얻었는지에 대한 것과 </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">그 내용이 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 좋은_동심\">『</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">제</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >3</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">편 진짜 세상을 향한 교실</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 좋은_동심\">』</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">이란 내용으로 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >5</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">월 중에 방영된다는 얘기들이었습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >. </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" ></SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">물론 참여하는 선생님들을 좀더 늘려 대규모로 올해 다시 진행해보고자 한다는 얘기두요</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >(</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">거꾸로교실</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >.kr</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">에서 신청받고 있답니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >.)</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">질의응답시간에서 제가 궁금해 했던 몇 가지에 대한 답들만 기억이 나는데요</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >. </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><STRONG><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >Q1. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">왜 부산에서 시작하였나</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >?</SPAN></STRONG></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >PD</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">님은 서울에서 가장 먼 곳이었기 때문이라 하시더군요</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >.</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 좋은_동심\">ㅎㅎ </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">농담처럼 시작한 대답에서 결론은 혁신은 비주류에서부터 시작된다는 믿음 때문에 교육광풍에서 떨어진 곳에서 그 효과를 찾고자하였다고 하시더군요</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" ></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><STRONG><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >Q2. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">거꾸로 교실을 운영하며 가장 힘들었던 점</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >?</SPAN></STRONG></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">실제 참여했던 선생님들의 공통적인 대답은 동영상제작</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">활동수업 준비</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">아이들을 믿는 마음이었습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >. </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">신혜쌤의 리뷰에서도 나왔듯이 동영상제작은 초반에 기술적인 부분이나 익숙하지 않은 프로그램의 사용 등으로 더디고 어려웠지만 시간이 지날수록 오히려 능숙해져서 뒤로 갈수록 어려움은 없어졌다고 하시구요</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">하지만 매차시 강의식 수업이 아닌 활동수업을 짜내고 활동지를 만들어야하는 것은 시간이 지나도 능숙해지지 않고 어떤 내용으로 어떤 활동을 할 것인지에 대한 고민이 매 차시 준비할 때마다 있다고 하셨습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >. (</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">교사간의 팀플레이가 가장 필요한 점이기도 하구요</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >.)</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">또한 아이들이 영상을 다 보고 왔을까</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >? </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">영상을 봤더라도 이 아이들이 그 내용을 다 이해했을까</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >? </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">지금 떠들고 시간만 때우는 게 아니라 무임승차하는 아이들 없이 다 참여하고 배움이 일어나고 있을까</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >? </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">거꾸로 수업을 하는내내 아이들을 믿지 못하는 마음과 갈등하였다고 하시더군요</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><STRONG><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >Q3. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">거꾸로 교실을 운영할 때 주의해야할 점</SPAN></STRONG></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >- </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">거꾸로 교실은 스마트 수업이 아닙니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >. </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >- </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">그리고 반드시 학생뿐 아니라 교사도 팀플레이가 필요한 수업입니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">방송에 나온 모습만 보면 거꾸로 교실은 한차시에 강의할 내용을 짧은 동영상으로 제작해 미리 아이들이 보고 오고</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">그 내용을 바탕으로 한 활동을 학교수업시간에 한다라고 드러난 부분만 보게 되면서 요즘 아이들의 입맛</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >(?)</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">에 맞춘 스마트</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >(</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">폰</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">기기</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >)</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">수업이라고 잘못 이해될 수도 있습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >.(</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">저 또한 조금은 그렇게 이해했던 부분도 있었네요</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >.)</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">실제의 핵심은 </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><STRONG><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >“1</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">대 다수의 강의식 수업을 비워내고</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">그 자리를 무엇으로 채울 것인가</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >!!!”</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">란 말로 정리할 수 있을 것 같습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">즉 동영상에서 학습이 일어나는게 아니라 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >45</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">분의 수업시간에 다양한 성취수준을 가진 아이들끼리의 협업으로 실제 배움을 일으키자 하는 것이지요</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">그리고 실제 이 부분에서 교사간의 협업도 필요합니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" ></SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">강연이 끝나고 난 뒤 이 부분에 대한 내용을 계속 고민하게 되었습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">아무튼 강연회의 현장풍경은 이정도로 전해드리고</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">함께 갔었던 선생님들과의 그 이후에 나눴던 이야기들</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 좋은_동심\">저의 고민들은 다음 글에서 정리해 볼까 합니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 좋은_동심; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 좋은_동심\" >.</SPAN></P>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
